==============================================================================
  Mutation tests  (assertion-strength validation)
==============================================================================

  Strategy: replace each named fact's body with `{}` (no constraint),
  then re-run Alloy. Each listed assertion should now FAIL on the
  mutated model. If it still PASSes, the assertion is vacuous and
  must be strengthened.

  - MUTATE F_AppendOnlyNotes  → runs/C-L2/mutated_F_AppendOnlyNotes.als
    rationale: Clearing F_AppendOnlyNotes drops the structural prohibition against mutating clinical notes; the injected fact then forces a note whose noteModified=BTrue, which the AppendOnly and FR_011 predicates explicitly forbid.
    expected to FAIL: AppendOnly, FR_011_NotesAppendOnly
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_011_NotesAppendOnly: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AppendOnlyAudit  → runs/C-L2/mutated_F_AppendOnlyAudit.als
    rationale: Clearing F_AppendOnlyAudit removes audit-entry immutability; the injection forces an audit entry with aeModified=BTrue, violating the append-only / retention invariants.
    expected to FAIL: AppendOnly, FR_014_AuditImmutable, FR_016_AuditRetention
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_014_AuditImmutable: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_016_AuditRetention: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_OneAuditPerOperation  → runs/C-L2/mutated_F_OneAuditPerOperation.als
    rationale: Clearing F_OneAuditPerOperation lets the model invent an operation without a matching audit entry; the injection forces exactly such an orphan, which AuditCompleteness rejects.
    expected to FAIL: AuditCompleteness, FR_012_OneAuditPerOp, FR_015_AuditOrRollback
      - AuditCompleteness: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_012_OneAuditPerOp: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_015_AuditOrRollback: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_CareTeamGating  → runs/C-L2/mutated_F_CareTeamGating.als
    rationale: Clearing F_CareTeamGating removes the requirement that a permitted clinical access be backed by an active care-team membership; the injection forces a Permitted RecordLookup with no such membership, which OwnershipBasedAccess catches.
    expected to FAIL: OwnershipBasedAccess, FR_004_CareTeamGating
      - OwnershipBasedAccess: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_004_CareTeamGating: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AdminContentBlind  → runs/C-L2/mutated_F_AdminContentBlind.als
    rationale: Clearing F_AdminContentBlind removes the rule that admin responses carry no clinical content; the injection forces an operation by a hospital_administrator that returns clinical content, breaking FR-005 and FR-018.
    expected to FAIL: NoInformationLeakage, FR_005_AdminNoClinicalContent, FR_018_NoClinicalLeakToAdmin
      - NoInformationLeakage: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_005_AdminNoClinicalContent: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_018_NoClinicalLeakToAdmin: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AuditFieldsMatch  → runs/C-L2/mutated_F_AuditFieldsMatch.als
    rationale: Clearing F_AuditFieldsMatch allows the audit-entry user/role snapshot to drift from the underlying operation; the injection forces an audit entry whose recorded user differs from the operation's actual caller, which AttributionCorrectness catches.
    expected to FAIL: AttributionCorrectness, FR_013_AuditFieldsMatch
      - AttributionCorrectness: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_013_AuditFieldsMatch: FAIL (expected)

